      "content": "The feeling of social isolation and the weight of external judgment can feel absolute, and it's understandable why you feel like there's nothing left. Even when things feel completely lost, the capacity for change still exists within you, even if it feels distant right now. Connecting with a support group, even online, can offer a sense of shared experience with others who understand this kind of deep loneliness.",
      "source": "target",
